---
source: crates/dreamd-cli/tests/cli_help.rs
expression: "subcommand_help(\"dream\")"
---
Run the deterministic dream cycle: promote top cluster to LESSONS.md, prune decayed episodic events

Usage: dream [OPTIONS]

Options:
      --dry
          Dry run: print the LESSONS.md this cycle would write, without writing anything. Skips the daemon proxy; --no-commit is ignored

      --no-commit
          Skip the autobiography commit. The cycle still runs and writes to disk; only the git2 commit step is skipped. Useful in CI

      --no-llm
          Force deterministic mode even when an API key is present

      --share-personal
          Include .agent/personal/ in the dream-cycle composition prompt for this call. Off by default: the personal layer never reaches a model unless this flag is passed. Capped at 16 KiB and ignored under --no-llm

  -h, --help
          Print help
